  "description": "1 to 10, from holding hands to kissing, everything in a relationship has to go according to plan for Geon-Jun. You can’t just skip over one stage to the other, not when everything needs to proceed in order—you gotta hit those bases one by one. Then there’s Jeong-Seok who’s the exact opposite, carefree and spontaneous and just looking for some fun. So just imagine Geon-Jun’s surprise when after one drunken night, he wakes up in the same bed with none other than Jeong-Seok. Looks like Geon-Jun’s gotta brace himself for a romance that defies the 1 to 10 rule, a rollercoaster ride of a love that’s gonna blow his mind for sure… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
